        "It rains four days out of five here. The fifth day, it thinks about raining.",
        "The ceilidh's on Saturday! Fiddles, bagpipes and a lot of spinning. Mind your feet. Mind everyone's feet.",
        "The midges in summer are tiny and there are millions of them. They're the real rulers of the glen.",
        "Porridge with salt, not sugar. That's how my granny made it. That's how her granny made it.",
        "The Highland games are next week: tossing the caber, throwing the hammer, and a lot of shouting.",
